<title>HONG KONG: HK's Honko Int'l debuts at HK$1.23.</title>
<headline>HK's Honko Int'l debuts at HK$1.23.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of transistor maker and distributor Honko International Holdings Ltd made their trading debut at HK$1.23 in Hong Kong on Monday, compared with an issue price of HK$1.00 per share.  </p>
<p>Honko International offered a total of 67 million shares with warrants in the proportion of one warrant  0640.HK for every five shares subscribed. It said the proceeds would be used to fund its expansion of production facilities.</p>
<p>Its offer was about 34.3 times subscribed.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
